5) Core User Stories (MVP acceptance criteria)
Guest

As a guest, I can search by game, platform, date, distance, party size, vibe, beginner-friendly, no-alcohol, BYO-controller.

I can see a map and list of parties, with distance and start time.

I can open Party Details to see host rating, rules, slots left, and required gear.

I can request to join (or auto-join) and receive a confirmation.

I only see the exact address after acceptance.

After attending, I can rate the host/party and report issues.

Host

As a host, I can create a party with:

Title, start & end time, city/area + precise address (masked pre-RSVP)

Max attendees, minimum age, vibe tags

Game(s), platform(s), network needs (LAN/Wi-Fi), BYO gear

House rules (no smoking, quiet after 10pm, etc.)

Join policy: auto-accept or approve-requests

I can edit/cancel the party and message attendees.

I can approve/deny requests and see a roster.

6) Filtering & Search (MVP)

Query params: q, game, platform, start=YYYY-MM-DD, radius=mi, vibe, size_min, size_max, beginner=true|false, byo=true|false, alcohol_free=true|false

Default radius 25 miles; sort by start time ascending and distance.

